  "evidence": [
    "Pinned world_rocky5C32A0 DWORD bit2+0C loads5C32DD/5C338F and climate BYTE+0 loads5C3399/5C33A5/5C33E2; checkerboard signed row/x loops, SAR half-x and44byte Map stride. Preserve signed masked-high-bit comparisons, reload after rocky_set, random call/order and original mineral/bit effects.",
    "Pinned world_shorelines5C3F70 contour BYTE+1 at5C3FB2 and climate BYTE+0 at5C4080, same stride/checkerboard iteration. Preserve AltNatural signed-depth threshold search, natural6..2 passes, redraw guards and per-row do_all_non_input cadence.",
    "Pinned clear_dirty592AF0 DWORD+0C read/store592B17/1F OR400000; linear Map walk with row parity and dimension rereads. Lock590140 and5900D0 tail BYTE+5 ANDC7 with signed MapArea initial/per-iteration checks and one cached allocation base. Existing Map uint8_t climate/contour/val3 and uint32_t bit2 layout supplies member views; no new original class or header layout claim.",
    "Edit only two source owners and focused actual-body tests. Keep deliberate raw map byte-stream/checksum consumers and helper globally. No safety fixes, manual marker edits, claims/demotions, original symbol changes or compiler policy changes. All Map/Lock records are measurement scope."
  ],
  "intent": "Replace raw tile stride/field casts in world_rocky, world_shorelines, clear_dirty and Lock reset/clear with the existing genuine Map members, preserving byte widths, count rereads and original branch/call effects.",
